": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162731_874801452683124_8480571075237773312_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uiJHSqMOM9gQ7kNvwG52Mw-&_nc_oc=AdodLKdyuZg_OAbrTHvYOH2EELN8poBrFaJJ0YcTg22lAiVMUqszbmoXmis8wDshj3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVLMqeA5qrLiBGlRO645VE_A7OE2i15ydGZglm352iElw&oe=6B10381E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "617753082397689", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_380404315735500_5291713739500814336_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pnIaKIJ0KiAQ7kNvwEqXNPi&_nc_oc=AdrTG10KrVXoCLVu5I-w_fhDv4Ckfw-gYSIJEgdjYAjWoikxNy3KsezDtkYCNbhGYrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXDVTap6O3LmvaoXmLNACJQqgM-jzG7es8KqVd9sS9yVg&oe=6B104331"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "231528434908924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162731_732867726913630_7537884319939821568_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VETl0VVVmlcQ7kNvwHO0BXI&_nc_oc=AdpITsSP6QbpigrB5bm0-4NK9bXbjCwqdRFijsQQFKBiMDkeufow4pbggFP37UUXi00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW762W0F_RFBpz5GDNfMLU61vXxkA-VR21oEhx4tRBOTg&oe=6B1062E0"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "212399816653872", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_1756596874645581_2822882841732317184_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nwSyFdiFIo8Q7kNvwG6DfUJ&_nc_oc=Adp4thC9O2XRnQEgK1ujok9cnzCRV6AAWVBcsjHTR3ABnMT34xD_98jUUe9Xocx9Wzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUi1T506oc4xKTHJZdIDWDI9PLjs-8snHOpVN27-D8pIg&oe=6B104EA0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "11162731_874801452683124_8480571075237773312_n.png", "id": "1673110742720080", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162694_1673110746053413_890324910616870912_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MWbgBxeDiP0Q7kNvwHZA20Z&_nc_oc=AdoErvmYn8_lTyUFrZBZ_kJhlegDevrWOXvv6ejwyBQDcew2zTqM7TTn13L23gzXKx4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU-1ypB9v_XPAmZtgb7UFrN5YCE8juYZH0wmBKeEHh17Q&oe=6B1054CD"}, "display_name": "Virry Safari 2: Feel the Wild", "keywords": ["animals", "video", "kids", "lion", "best"], "long_description": "Winner of the Webby Award 2017 in \u2018VR: Gaming, Interactive, or Real-time\u2019. Virry VR is a virtual safari filmed in 4K VR at Lewa Wildlife Conservancy, Kenyan home of the most endangered African megafauna: Black and White Rhinos, Lions and African elephants. \n35 min of 8 live-action interactive experiences, where you are really up close while feeding and communicating with wild animals: Zebras, Vervets, Hyena and Leopard, in addition to the ones mentioned above. Also 3 live cameras!\n\n\u201cI have seen thousands of spherical videos, and the footage from Virry VR is the most stunning nature scenes I have ever seen in any medium. Seeing a big rhino, in its natural home, from the perspective of a mud puddle inches away, or having a lion literally lick my face to test if I am edible, were among the coolest things I have done in VR to date.\u201d\nJeremy Bailenson, Founding Director of The Virtual Human Interaction Lab, Stanford University.", "short_description": "Winner of the Webby Award 2017 in \u2018VR: Gaming, Interactive, or Real-time\u2019. Virry VR is a virtual safari filmed in 4K VR at Lewa Wildlife Conservancy, Kenyan home of the most endangered African megafauna: Black and White Rhinos, Lions and African elephants. \n35 min of 8 live-action interactive experiences, where you are really up close while feeding and communicating with wild animals: Zebras, Vervets, Hyena and Leopard, in addition to the ones mentioned above. Also 3 live cameras!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develo